{"unit_id":"gaolei-mark43__dsh-github-bridge#card-zh","repo":"gaolei-mark43/dsh-github-bridge","commit":"959de3cf233c38c5974a6771aeb46d75c13ab83d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-github-bridge 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 GitHub 集成插件，通过工具注册和设置页认证卡片接入 GitHub。它支持 OAuth 设备码登录、查看用户和仓库、读取与搜索仓库文件、列出议题和 Pull Request，并可创建 issue，也提供通用 REST API 请求。适合希望在 DSH 对话中查询或维护 GitHub 项目的用户。使用前需配置 GitHub OAuth App Client ID 并登录；令牌保存在 DSH credentials，也可从 GITHUB_TOKEN 环境变量读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:214-277","src/index.js:279-620","src/index.js:623-720","client/client.js:163-200"]}
